<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets 1.0 bln Ffr structured bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets 1.0 bln Ffr structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bankers Trust and CDC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON    *4.6	 MATURITY    12.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE FIXED/FRN	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
